  "summary": "<p>This morning, Attorney General Todd Blanche appeared on the Sunday shows and made clear that the Department of Justice will fulfill its Constitutional duty to represent the Executive Branch — and that Democrats’ explicit threats of endless investigations, impeachments, and retribution against President Trump, Cabinet officials, and private citizens will not succeed. Key exchanges:</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/icymi-ag-todd-blanche-dismantles-democrats-oversight-charade-on-the-sunday-shows/\">ICYMI: AG Todd Blanche Dismantles Democrats’ “Oversight” Charade on the Sunday Shows</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
